Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.34,0:00:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.63,0:00:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,貓？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.43,0:00:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你認得貓啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.97,0:00:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜歡貓嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.89,0:00:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  不會討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.22,0:00:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.35,0:00:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你看  大家都知道喔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.68,0:00:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我也知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.85,0:00:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,只是貓在我的星球身價不菲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,平常不太有機會看到而已
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…你的脖子是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.32,0:00:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不用那麼怕啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,現在人體改造也不稀奇了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.41,0:00:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,話雖如此  那種改造還真是不常見
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.75,0:00:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是喔？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.71,0:00:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不過我也不是自願\N維持這樣不上不下的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.38,0:00:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫尤里  對吧？我是希皮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.17,0:00:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我是柯梅特
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.01,0:00:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.93,0:00:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,每次輪迴又會有新的人加入
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.93,0:00:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,到底會增加到多少人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.42,0:01:04.86,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Change! さぁ化けな Growl Growl Growl
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.93,0:01:10.56,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Change! 蛻變化身吧 Growl Growl Growl
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:13.45,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.32,0:01:16.17,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ざばぁん
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.41,0:01:18.99,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}潜伏しながら行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:21.61,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Guess Doubt 壊れる思考
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.72,0:01:24.24,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}人の殻破り 突き出る角
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:26.12,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}正気はいらないさ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:27.54,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}I'll take you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.54,0:01:28.87,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}破れハウトゥー
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.87,0:01:31.71,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}笑えるわ 裏切りだらけの生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.71,0:01:32.87,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Bet on me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.87,0:01:35.13,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}吊し上げて堕とす
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.13,0:01:38.66,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}それでは皆 Nice tripを
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.26,0:01:43.35,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}手を伸ばしたその先に幸よあれ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.35,0:01:44.55,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}廻り廻って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.55,0:01:45.94,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}変わり変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:48.04,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}人の形捨て
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.45,0:01:49.70,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.99,0:01:53.48,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}救いよあれ 騙し騙されのゲーム
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.62,0:01:57.01,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}一心不乱にあがいて 切り裂く逆境
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.01,0:01:59.44,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}足元にTake care
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.44,0:02:00.46,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.00,0:02:04.41,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}憂いのない 電脳化されたHeaven
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.57,0:02:06.47,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}一瞬の油断が最後
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.47,0:02:10.31,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}剥ぎ取るよ化けの皮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.31,0:02:13.28,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.37,0:02:15.79,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Change! さぁ化けな Growl Growl Growl
